			"Message": "chore(Mountain): Strip verbose build identifiers, restore compact names\n\nRevert the DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency verbose naming scheme introduced in the previous commit for Cargo.toml bin/lib/package names and tauri.conf.json identifier/productName. Replace identifier with the stable \"fiddee.editor.binary\" key and set productName to \"Mountain\".\n\nAlso collapse externalBin and targets arrays back to single-line format (reverting the formatting change from the previous commit) and delete the .Backup files that were created alongside the verbose identifiers.\n\nThe verbose identifiers were only needed during a transitional Electron-profile debugging phase and are no longer required for the production Rust/Tauri pipeline.",
			"SHA": "f3219cd8532d03baa1cef3f2a23e51c026653c44"
		},
